could be shipped): `command -v hork__is_converged >/dev/null 2>&1`, `command -v
hork >/dev/null 2>&1`, `command -v wombat >/dev/null 2>&1` -- run `dorc why` for
the per-site detail (the apply runs each anyway, to stay safe)
